 "rule": "LynkDriver is one free, signed pack that drives every kind of hardware LynkOmni uses. It installs online from Devices > Driver in the Business app or offline from lynkomni.com/download/driver, and the app asks to install it as soon as hardware that needs it is attached. Updates are strongly enforced: a security update is required now, a required update within 3 days, a normal update within 7 days. Past the deadline the hardware pauses and the matching virtual device takes over, so a sale is never blocked. Payment card readers and fiscal devices are certified by their licensed provider or authority; LynkDriver only connects them. core/drivers.py and ts/src/drivers.ts apply this file.",
